WEBVTT

00:02.860 --> 00:04.420
We're guardians.

00:04.930 --> 00:08.470
We protect the Tamayori princess and keep the Onikirimaru sealed.

00:08.470 --> 00:10.000
That's our fate.

00:10.610 --> 00:11.870
But...

00:11.870 --> 00:13.210
What each of us does,

00:13.210 --> 00:15.040
what each of us thinks,

00:15.040 --> 00:16.310
is completely different.

00:17.150 --> 00:19.050
Can you...

00:19.050 --> 00:21.680
Can you even call us guardians?!

01:56.480 --> 02:00.480
The Destruction

01:56.480 --> 02:00.480
of the Five

01:56.480 --> 02:00.480
Guardian Families

01:59.380 --> 02:01.580
I won't ask you to understand.

02:02.480 --> 02:05.050
But everything I did,

02:05.050 --> 02:07.390
I did because I thought it was right.

02:08.960 --> 02:11.630
When I say that I did this for everyone's sake,

02:11.630 --> 02:12.920
I'm not lying.

02:13.290 --> 02:14.060
What?

02:14.760 --> 02:15.860
Mahiro.

02:19.430 --> 02:20.990
Excuse me!

02:24.640 --> 02:25.900
Shinji!

02:28.780 --> 02:31.080
Mitsuru...

02:37.520 --> 02:38.450
Shinji!

02:42.920 --> 02:43.820
Tamaki.

02:48.200 --> 02:50.460
What? Let me go!

03:01.280 --> 03:02.970
The gods are restless.

03:08.520 --> 03:11.650
<i>It's only sleeping.</i>

03:12.720 --> 03:13.450
No way.

03:13.990 --> 03:17.520
But the Onikirimaru was sealed.

03:23.460 --> 03:26.430
It doesn't look like anything's wrong.

03:34.180 --> 03:36.840
In any case, let's check the forest.

03:36.840 --> 03:38.050
Right.

03:38.050 --> 03:40.220
We might find something out about the spiriting away

03:40.220 --> 03:41.420
incidents that have been occurring.

03:41.420 --> 03:42.350
Yes.

04:10.750 --> 04:12.910
The forest is restless.

04:14.680 --> 04:16.650
It seems that way.

04:20.790 --> 04:22.050
Monado Aria,

04:22.460 --> 04:26.530
I believe it has come time for us to move,

04:26.530 --> 04:29.700
if you accept my humble opinion.

04:29.700 --> 04:30.630
Drei.

04:31.430 --> 04:33.300
The will of Logos is supposed

04:33.300 --> 04:35.800
to be determined by the four wise men and the

04:35.800 --> 04:37.570
main branch and the Black Book.

04:38.210 --> 04:39.700
Of course.

04:40.070 --> 04:41.610
Therefore,

04:41.610 --> 04:44.310
as long as I cannot contact them,

04:44.310 --> 04:46.710
I have no intention of moving.

04:51.990 --> 04:53.250
Understood.

05:03.970 --> 05:05.190
Eins.

05:08.670 --> 05:11.470
Is there something else, Eins?

05:12.810 --> 05:15.240
I'll escort you.

05:15.540 --> 05:20.310
Why? I am by Aria's side.

05:21.180 --> 05:24.640
Untrustworthy newcomers are here.

05:25.650 --> 05:27.820
You cannot be too careful.

05:29.190 --> 05:33.060
A legitimate reason to protect me.

05:40.870 --> 05:41.840
There they are.

05:42.440 --> 05:43.410
Yes.

05:44.370 --> 05:46.470
<i>Want to eat...</i>

05:46.470 --> 05:48.340
<i>Want to eat...</i>

05:48.840 --> 05:52.910
<i>Want to eat Tamayori blood...</i>

05:54.050 --> 05:59.150
Looks like the drowned gods are drawn to the Tamayori's blood.

05:59.850 --> 06:01.190
But why won't they

06:01.190 --> 06:03.280
attempt to come any closer?

06:03.790 --> 06:07.130
Yeah, I don't get it.

06:21.640 --> 06:23.470
Tamaki, you go back.

06:24.980 --> 06:27.010
But I want to see it.

06:27.010 --> 06:30.450
I can sense something much stronger ahead of here.

06:30.990 --> 06:32.720
I want to see it with my own eyes.

06:36.320 --> 06:37.720
All right. Let's hurry.

06:38.730 --> 06:39.390
Yes.

06:59.850 --> 07:00.780
This is...

07:32.450 --> 07:33.750
You're...

07:35.080 --> 07:36.980
Apparition of this distant region,

07:36.980 --> 07:39.250
take my blows and disappear!

07:47.130 --> 07:48.600
The mountain god.

07:49.330 --> 07:51.300
So you were alive.

07:51.870 --> 07:55.470
<i>I have lived for a thousand years.</i>

07:55.470 --> 07:57.870
<i>Such an attack is not enough to kill me,</i>

07:58.470 --> 08:03.410
<i>though I may require some sleep.</i>

08:06.580 --> 08:11.990
<i>However, the gods are becoming restless.</i>

08:11.990 --> 08:14.790
<i>They do not let me sleep.</i>

08:15.820 --> 08:17.950
Why is that?

08:20.060 --> 08:22.160
<i>Tamayori Princess.</i>

08:23.330 --> 08:28.170
<i>Someone as weak as you questions me?</i>

08:31.370 --> 08:33.040
Please tell me.

08:33.040 --> 08:34.910
Is the Onikirimaru once again waking?

08:34.910 --> 08:37.540
Is that why the gods are restless?

08:39.850 --> 08:41.010
<i>Indeed.</i>

08:41.520 --> 08:46.450
<i>This gives the gods strength in the present world,</i>

08:46.450 --> 08:50.730
<i>and the excess strength drives them mad.</i>

08:50.730 --> 08:52.750
So that's why the spiriting away is happening again?

08:53.190 --> 08:54.590
<i>I don't know.</i>

08:55.300 --> 08:59.320
<i>But the gods are not that restless.</i>

09:00.070 --> 09:03.600
<i>Though eventually that will become reality.</i>

09:05.710 --> 09:09.010
<i>Either way, put it back to sleep quickly.</i>

09:09.210 --> 09:10.140
What?!

09:10.680 --> 09:11.910
<i>Demon,</i>

09:13.510 --> 09:17.980
<i>I sense a disturbance in the strength that sleeps within you.</i>

09:20.860 --> 09:26.660
<i>When the time comes, it will be in your best interests to end your life.</i>

09:27.700 --> 09:29.660
What do you mean?

09:38.070 --> 09:39.170
I see.

09:40.780 --> 09:43.080
What do you mean, "I see?"

09:43.080 --> 09:43.770
Takuma.

09:44.450 --> 09:46.380
Hey, what's going on?

09:48.320 --> 09:50.580
When I last fought with Logos,

09:51.190 --> 09:54.450
I was almost overwhelmed by the demon inside me,

09:55.490 --> 09:57.890
and I thought I was able to suppress it somehow.

09:59.590 --> 10:00.620
But...

10:01.430 --> 10:03.990
But? What is it, Takuma?

10:06.100 --> 10:10.540
Recently, I've felt this power welling up inside me.

10:12.010 --> 10:13.770
I'm helpless against it.

10:13.770 --> 10:15.210
Just like back then,

10:15.210 --> 10:17.910
it's a power that I feel like I cannot control.

10:28.060 --> 10:30.890
It grows stronger every day.

10:33.160 --> 10:35.630
Perhaps I, like the Onikirimaru,

10:35.630 --> 10:38.900
haven't completely suppressed the demon inside.

10:39.700 --> 10:40.900
That's...

10:53.110 --> 10:53.950
That's right.

10:55.250 --> 10:57.810
There's a demon inside Takuma.

10:58.290 --> 11:01.920
The seal on the Onikirimaru was not complete.

11:03.190 --> 11:05.320
Why didn't you tell me?

11:06.130 --> 11:07.760
If there was something
I could have done,

11:07.760 --> 11:10.500
I would have liked to deal with it,

11:10.500 --> 11:12.630
but my strength is no longer enough...

11:13.570 --> 11:15.970
Then what should we do now?

11:16.540 --> 11:22.000
That's something that you, as the
Tamayori princess, must decide.

11:26.050 --> 11:30.990
What happens henceforth is up to you, Tamaki.

11:44.800 --> 11:46.000
Did you call?

11:46.000 --> 11:46.660
No.

11:50.100 --> 11:51.310
Here.

11:51.310 --> 11:53.040
Sweet things will cheer you up.

11:57.010 --> 11:58.640
Thank you, Kiyono.

12:05.850 --> 12:08.060
So Takuma took the day off?

12:08.060 --> 12:08.890
Yes.

12:08.890 --> 12:10.590
He didn't look too good.

12:11.530 --> 12:12.460
What about Shinji?

12:13.260 --> 12:15.890
He probably just can't bear to see us.

12:18.030 --> 12:19.270
I'll go call him.

12:19.270 --> 12:20.630
No, I'll go.

12:21.540 --> 12:22.660
Yuichi.

12:23.100 --> 12:26.870
He may need some time.

12:32.410 --> 12:33.470
Thank you.

12:44.560 --> 12:46.080
About yesterday...

12:48.100 --> 12:49.430
Don't worry too much.

12:50.460 --> 12:51.730
Leave it all to me.

12:53.970 --> 12:55.540
It's all right.

12:55.540 --> 12:58.740
When I, Mahiro Atori, say I'll do something about it,

12:58.740 --> 12:59.930
something will be done about it.

13:01.310 --> 13:02.710
It's completely baseless, though.

13:04.580 --> 13:06.450
What's that?

13:06.450 --> 13:07.780
But, you're right.

13:08.220 --> 13:11.850
As long as we don't give up, there's a way.

13:12.450 --> 13:13.050
Yeah.

13:14.820 --> 13:15.720
Mahiro,

13:17.830 --> 13:22.130
I'll do my best to become a stronger Tamayori princess.

13:22.760 --> 13:23.630
That's right.

13:23.900 --> 13:28.100
If you don't smile like that,
I can't do my best, either.

13:28.500 --> 13:28.990
Yes.

13:32.910 --> 13:34.340
Hey.

13:34.340 --> 13:35.470
Takuma.

13:36.280 --> 13:37.250
Are you all right?

13:37.880 --> 13:40.610
Yeah. When I woke up it was past noon,

13:40.610 --> 13:41.910
so I panicked a little.

13:43.250 --> 13:44.080
What?!

13:44.490 --> 13:47.110
That's why you weren't at school?

13:48.160 --> 13:50.950
I shouldn't have worried about you.

13:53.460 --> 13:55.100
Yup.

13:55.100 --> 13:59.290
If you don't smile like that,
I can't do my best.

14:03.140 --> 14:04.610
By Takuma's side...

14:09.840 --> 14:10.780
It's beautiful.

14:12.710 --> 14:16.740
I'm just now realizing that it's the height of fall already.

14:22.520 --> 14:23.680
Damn it...

14:25.360 --> 14:26.990
I can't suppress it.

14:30.900 --> 14:31.800
Takuma!

14:33.530 --> 14:35.440
Please, be calm.

14:36.900 --> 14:37.840
Please.

14:48.020 --> 14:49.850
It's all right now.

14:50.750 --> 14:52.420
Thank you.

14:52.420 --> 14:54.820
I thought it was all over, but...

14:55.720 --> 14:56.820
I'm sorry.

14:57.590 --> 14:58.490
For what?

15:01.100 --> 15:03.600
Everyone's so nice, so they don't say anything,

15:03.600 --> 15:06.000
but I realized after hearing what Grandma said.

15:06.700 --> 15:09.190
I wasn't strong enough.

15:10.770 --> 15:12.240
That's why, Takuma...

15:13.870 --> 15:15.240
Don't make that face.

15:16.210 --> 15:17.700
It's not your fault.

15:18.110 --> 15:18.910
But...

15:20.450 --> 15:22.350
When I'm with you,

15:22.350 --> 15:25.380
only then can I truly be myself.

15:27.450 --> 15:28.390
Takuma...

15:49.610 --> 15:50.770
Kotokura.

15:52.110 --> 15:54.380
If you'd like, please eat this.

15:56.520 --> 15:59.280
I thought you hadn't eaten much since then.

16:00.750 --> 16:04.780
A guardian mustn't be hindered in any way.

16:06.290 --> 16:07.120
Yes.

16:07.930 --> 16:09.060
Thank you.

16:10.970 --> 16:14.200
When I was little, something similar to this happened.

16:14.840 --> 16:20.510
Mahiro got mad at me, and as I sat here, depressed by myself,

16:20.510 --> 16:23.640
you came and gave me a piece of candy.

16:27.080 --> 16:33.420
If only we could go back to when we would all play happily together,

16:34.490 --> 16:35.790
when nothing was wrong.

16:42.130 --> 16:46.070
I want to go back to that time before I knew anything, too,

16:46.870 --> 16:48.800
and leave this village.

16:56.210 --> 16:57.480
I'm sorry.

16:57.480 --> 17:02.040
I said something strange, and I made you feel bad.

17:04.120 --> 17:05.950
I'm all right now.

17:07.860 --> 17:10.260
Thank you for the food, really.

17:24.340 --> 17:26.710
What should I do?

17:26.710 --> 17:29.540
All of the Artifacts are already ours.

17:30.510 --> 17:35.140
If only Aria would make her move, it would all be over.

17:36.850 --> 17:38.380
It's unsatisfying.

17:43.790 --> 17:48.160
There's no fun in not making a move.

17:48.160 --> 17:52.070
And having fun is said to be the sign of talent.

17:54.070 --> 17:55.970
What do you think, Snake?

17:57.770 --> 18:02.140
What do you think about doing some work for us?

18:02.510 --> 18:03.270
Such as what?

18:05.010 --> 18:10.920
How about guiding us to the reawakened Artifact?

18:12.790 --> 18:14.020
Understood.

18:15.790 --> 18:20.190
So you're saying Ohmi went to Logos to steal back the Artifacts?

18:20.460 --> 18:24.060
I have no evidence, but he probably would have noticed

18:24.060 --> 18:26.860
that the seal was incomplete before we did.

18:27.470 --> 18:30.670
Well, it wouldn't be impossible for Ohmi.

18:35.380 --> 18:38.380
When we fought with
Logos here that time,

18:38.380 --> 18:42.210
Tamaki appeared to have awakened as the Tamayori princess.

18:43.780 --> 18:46.020
As Tamayori princess, I command you:

18:48.320 --> 18:49.850
Calm yourself!

18:56.460 --> 18:59.770
As a result, the Onikirimaru's power was sealed,

18:59.770 --> 19:03.330
if only for a moment, and was enshrined in the temple.

19:05.740 --> 19:09.070
But now, its power is leaking out.

19:09.440 --> 19:12.750
So to completely seal it, we would need

19:12.750 --> 19:15.610
to get the Artifacts back, along with Tamaki.

19:16.120 --> 19:19.020
So you're saying we can seal the Onikirimaru?

19:19.020 --> 19:20.080
Yes.

19:20.420 --> 19:21.620
I see.

19:22.160 --> 19:27.090
But then why didn't Ohmi say anything to us?

19:27.460 --> 19:30.450
To deceive your enemy, first deceive your friends, or so they say.

19:31.770 --> 19:33.630
That's so cold.

19:33.930 --> 19:36.400
What are we the Shugogo for?

19:38.210 --> 19:40.710
I guess telling you that won't help.

19:40.710 --> 19:42.140
All right, let's go!

19:42.540 --> 19:43.310
Where to?

19:44.140 --> 19:46.050
Isn't it obvious?

19:46.050 --> 19:48.650
To help Ohmi steal back the Artifacts!

19:48.650 --> 19:49.640
No.

19:50.650 --> 19:54.860
Going now would only hinder Ohmi,

19:54.860 --> 19:57.260
who's managed to infiltrate the enemy.

19:57.260 --> 19:58.230
Then...!

20:00.660 --> 20:04.960
I thought to patrol the woods and keep an eye on Logos' movement, but...

20:08.900 --> 20:09.870
Over there!

20:20.650 --> 20:21.920
Was that...

20:21.920 --> 20:22.880
Yes.

20:33.260 --> 20:35.600
What's wrong, Snake?

20:35.600 --> 20:39.870
Beyond here, the Tamayori's barrier is stronger.

20:39.870 --> 20:42.730
Even I cannot go any further.

21:00.890 --> 21:05.550
So, the Artifact is beyond here?

21:10.760 --> 21:11.700
Yes.

21:37.220 --> 21:38.520
Ohmi.

23:21.330 --> 23:22.490
Ah, the crow.

23:24.830 --> 23:27.320
Why don't we observe this time?

23:27.870 --> 23:29.300
Snake...

23:37.580 --> 23:43.410
I can fall asleep anywhere, but I sleep most at ease...

23:45.850 --> 23:47.820
when I'm by your side.

23:51.430 --> 23:55.660
That's how comfortable it is to be next to you.

23:56.130 --> 24:01.030
Next Time: The Truth of Tears
